# r10n Environment Variables
# Optional: copy this file to local/.env for Python automation settings.
# Existing shell environment variables take precedence over local/.env.
#
# No environment variables are required for the bundled automations.
# Configure email credentials in local/configs/email.json, not in this file.
# Never commit either local/.env or populated email configuration files.
#
# Native CLI/launcher settings such as R10N_ACCESSIBLE, R10N_PROJECT,
# R10N_NATIVE and GITHUB_TOKEN must be exported in your shell; the Go
# frontend does not read local/.env.
#
# Add environment settings used by your own Python automations below.
